 "conclusion":
 "You've made use of the concept that \"false implies anything\".\n\n----\n```\nh           : S     → False\nfalse_elim  : False → B\n```\nBecause the righthand side of `h` and the lefthand side of `false_elim` match, you can use `imp_trans` to combine these:\n```\nimp_trans h false_elim\n```"}